" 0.15*Lb;\nRcnv = Lcnv*wb/10;\nfc = 5000;\nVd = 2*sqrt(2)*1.1*Vb/sqrt(3);\nma"
" = 0.95;\n\nTs = 1e-6;\nac = 2200;\nacV = 220;\n\n\n\nwn = 2*wb;\nwa = 4*wb;"
"\nz = 0.7;\nza = 0.2;\nKn = 2;\nKp = 2;\n\n\nkpv = 50*(0.15*Lb*ac);\nkiv = 1*"
"(4.225*ac);\n\nkpv_neg = 0*(0.15*Lb*ac);\nkiv_neg = 0.0001*(4.225*ac);\n\n\nI"
"max_sat = 1.2*Sb/(sqrt(3)*Vb);\nImax_sat_start = 1*Sb/(sqrt(3)*Vb);\nImax_sat"
"_neg = 0.12*Sb/(sqrt(3)*Vb);\n\nKp_gfm = 0.025;\nKi_gfm = 0.1;\n\nKp_gfm_neg "
"= 0.4;\nKi_gfm_neg = 1;\n\nIbase_fraction= 0.1*[Imax_sat/1.2];"
